\Section{The current estimate is selected by date}
For each channel--need cell, \Code{channel_cac_current.csv} selects the test with the latest completed follow-up. Selection does not depend on its point estimate or statistical significance. Incomplete windows are rejected before analysis. If lift is nonpositive, iCAC is undefined; a weak new result does not justify reverting to an older favorable estimate.
