\PageTitle{D6 / HISTORICAL VALUATION}{Observed and forecast\newline components of historical value}{Technical appendix | Training includes the calendar month beginning \VAR{valuation_backtest_origin}; later calendar months are used only for scoring.}
\VAR{valuation_backtest_sentence}
