\PageTitle{E8 / EXHIBIT PROVENANCE}{From executive exhibits\newline to saved results}{The implementation manifest binds code, instructions, templates, dependencies and the source assets.}
\TableCaption{source-map-b}{Main report exhibits and their saved sources.}
\VAR{b_source_map}
\Section{Summary quantities and display conventions}
\Code{executive_metrics.csv} records the matched windows, customer weights and primary outcomes. \Code{version-b-evidence.json} records the cash-improvement decomposition and the selected investment case. The machine-readable \Code{exhibit-source-map.json} preserves these connections.

The main report uses whole dollars unless a finer unit matters. Calculations use unrounded values. Payment one is the joining month; a technical age index of zero denotes that same month. Later payment numbers mark monthly renewal opportunities, with departed customers retained in the original denominator. First-year value discounts twelve contribution receipts at 1\% per month. Cash recovery is the first undiscounted crossing of the relevant acquisition cost.

Appendix exhibits retain their local source notes. The eight dataset tables preserve literal field names so they can be copied into queries.

